Media Requirements
Use the provided rescue ZIP file. 
Your site should include:

About Us - Adoptable pet photo
Services - Volunteer or event photo
Home - One figure featuring a pet spotlight with a caption
? - One responsive featured image using the <picture> element
Contact - One short director or coordinator video message with fallback text

Form Focus
The form should collect:

Name
Email
Interest type, such as volunteer, foster, or adoption information
Availability
